l, swap, and even THROW enemies to dodge their attacks and make them smack each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CRAFT YOUR OWN CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/4547f1bcc94bd52a47112224699f4bfd.poster.avif?t=1790266846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/4547f1bcc94bd52a47112224699f4bfd.webm?t=1790266846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/4547f1bcc94bd52a47112224699f4bfd.mp4?t=1790266846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine ANY cards together, as many times as you want! Create crazy combinations, or even combine all cards into one ultimate card!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPGRADE YOUR GEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/e287c9efc18d7e50468368d030d75b67.poster.avif?t=1790266846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/e287c9efc18d7e50468368d030d75b67.webm?t=1790266846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071820/extras/e287c9efc18d7e50468368d030d75b67.mp4?t=1790266846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn powerful equipment that changes the game, upgrade them to game-breaking levels, and become a total fashionista!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWER UP AND HUNT HARDER BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_c